            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "serve. If the parties are unable to agree upon an arbitrator or to obtain such commitment within the specified period, a request for arbitration shall be sent to the American Arbitration Association and a list of arbitrators requested. A copy of the demand shall be sent to the other party. The parties will then be bound by the rules and procedures of the American Arbitration Association as they apply to the selection of an arbitrator.",
