        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. The administrative complaint procedure currently in use to process and resolve unit member complaints pertaining to matters not covered by this Agreement or subject to collective bargaining shall be continued. Matters subject to the grievance procedure and subject to collective bargaining consistent with Article 5, Section J, shall not be heard or processed under the administrative complaint procedure.",
